{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-02_beg","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-02","title":"一丝光亮","storyCode":"11-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"02a6b5e4024d879256373d9293665e71605dbe53725f52145f93addb5879993e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"四年前，斯塔福德公爵在伦蒂尼姆城内掀起叛乱，混乱之际，戈尔丁救了负伤的海蒂。海蒂坚持要将情报送出城。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"四年前\n1094年\n3:25 P.M. 天气/阴\n伦蒂尼姆奥克特里格区，圣马尔索学校"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！看看议会广场上的士兵们吧，看看那些弩箭与火炮，您已经无路可逃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"别哭啊，你不该哭的，抬起头来！你现在扮演的可是国王！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......杀、杀了你们！我、我还有那些阁......阁楼骑士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"是塔楼骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"他们大多投降啦。那些不投降的顽固分子，也很快就会跟您一样，被我们和......我们所代表的，伦蒂尼姆的怒火审判。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁、谁能审判一个国王？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"以前并没有人，以后或许也不会有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下，您是自寻死路。您挡住了维多利亚前行的步伐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"整座城市的机器都因您的一声令下而停止了转动，您还想从苦恼的人们兜里抢走他们买面包的最后一个便士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的双手原本只是为了明天的太阳而劳作。是您和您贪婪的侍从们逼着我们......逼我们沾上您的鲜血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"上吧，战士们！为了维多利亚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚......！我......我就是维多利亚......你们岂敢！维多利亚不会放过你们，就算我变成了幽......幽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"是幽灵！幽——灵！你得先跑到那边的台阶上，然后倒下来，才能说这句话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁在门廊这儿跑来跑去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉尔夫，安娜，你们两个小捣蛋鬼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是茉莉姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"马上就到最好玩的地方啦！安娜，快跑到台阶上，我们马上开始绞刑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绞刑......绞刑？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁教你们玩这种残忍的游戏的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"斜巷子里的大人们都这么玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斜巷子......那里什么人都有。你们是看到什么不入流的戏了吗？谁带你们去看的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"鞋匠汤姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"他喝了很多黄色的饮料，很多从他脸上淌了下来。他还冲着台上的人大吼大叫，说什么“不许你们侮辱国王陛下，他是个伟大的好人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个混账汤姆！不，我不该在孩子们面前表现得这么粗鲁......可是他怎么能带小孩子去酒馆？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我们继续吧，安娜，在吃晚饭之前，我还想从头再玩一次呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那该轮到你扮演死人啦！拉尔夫，你答应我的，不许骗人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下呀......请原谅孩子们对您的不敬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都未曾见过您，也没听过您的声音，只从这些街头巷尾的胡闹里听过您的传闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉姐姐，你明明也没见过国王吧，就别用这种老气横秋的语气教训我啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"快跑呀，安娜，我来追你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚开，叛......叛徒！你们迟早会被心里面的野兽咬死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们，这可一点儿都不体面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想受罚的话，还是赶快停下来吧，可千万别让其他修士和老师们撞见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撞见什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁女士，您来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉尔夫，你怎么面红耳赤的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那是因为......因为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在做游戏，女士。这个游戏可好玩啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"游戏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我知道了。早些回寝室吧，别忘了做今天的功课。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，拉尔夫，虽然茉莉小姐只比你们年长几岁，但她也是你们的老师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"是，女士。对不起，茉莉姐姐——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，听女士的话，都回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到您没有批评那两个孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉尔夫和安娜？我不怪他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们只是还未能理解什么是残忍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们有渴望学习的天性。要是不能从书本和我们身上学到什么是正确的东西，他们的视线自然而然会投向其他方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......很多人都说那场绞刑改变了维多利亚。戈尔丁女士，您也同意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同一个问题询问不同的人，只会得到不同的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海布里区的军工厂里，机器从未停止过轰鸣，奥克特里格区的大宅子却有许多换了主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我只知道每年依然有许多可怜的孩子被送到我们的学校里。他们就和二十多年前的我一样需要帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢学校，要不是学校收留了我，我也早就得病死啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉，刚才的事让我有了个新主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新主意......您是指这几本您拿在手里的戏剧集吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来这些书本是为孩子们准备的。可是他们才刚刚认字，这会不会为时过早？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总比斜巷子里那些博人眼球，粗制滥造的东西要强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对年幼的孩子们而言，扮演其他角色就和玩游戏差不多。在理解复杂的含义之前，他们至少能先体会到些许蕴含在字句中的情感与力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿您是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且还有一个好处，不是吗？孩子们不会在我的文学课上昏昏欲睡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，这倒是没错。别的不说，只要能消耗一点他们的精力，我就也轻松多啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉女士们，书店得提前关门了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亚当斯先生，您今天歇得真早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您还没听说吗？今天早上，卡登区的公爵办事处发生了一场骚乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骚乱？什么样的骚乱会影响到奥克特里格区？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一名办事处的官员被打死了。据说他是斯塔福德公爵的侄子，一周之前刚刚进入伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可怜的人。警察抓到谋杀犯了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问题就在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有目击者说，那个嫌犯逃进了城防军的营地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"快，封住这个街区！别让那人逃了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"仔细找找——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道那个嫌犯又逃到了奥克特里格区吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好说，女士，事情可能没有这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，这些士兵是城防军吗？莫非我看错了，为什么他们身上穿着的制服和我印象中的不太一样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我有个朋友就住在卡登区，他说附近街道上出现了许多士兵，他们都穿着这种制服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至还有消息说......说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一位公爵已经在昨天秘密进入了伦蒂尼姆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是这怎么可能呢？这不是被法律禁止的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亚当斯先生，谢谢您，这些书太重了，我下次再来取。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉，我们得尽快回学校。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"没人？不是说看到有个影子藏在小巷子里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"不能让公爵大人的消息流出伦蒂尼姆！否则的话，今天的行动就......该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"连男女都没看清，这些伦蒂尼姆办事处里的情报人员都是怎么办事的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"一群饭桶！比公爵领的人差远了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"幸亏我刚刚射中了一箭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"继续追，他应该逃不了多远！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁女士，您是注意到什么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是什么紧要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉，你先回学校，把孩子们都集合起来，别让他们跑到街上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去见一位朋友。替我在办公室里准备热水和一条干净的毛巾吧，我马上回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，请忍耐一下。学校的条件还是简陋了些，毕竟孩子们通常只会在打闹中跌倒，而不会被士兵的弩箭射伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到......你还会缝合伤口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每年学校收到的捐赠都很有限，我们雇不起那么多人手。很多时候我还得兼职校医。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你走在路上的时候一声不吭，我还以为你感觉不到疼痛呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可别嘲笑我了......在伦蒂尼姆，只有来到你面前，我才能真正松口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能帮你缝合伤口，却做不到预防感染。海蒂，你最好立刻去医院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能告诉我为什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为我们是朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来就不该跟你回到这里。戈尔丁，我不想把你和你的孩子们扯进麻烦里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，士兵们在追的人的确是你。他们真的是斯塔福德公爵的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是亚当斯告诉你的吗？我以为他不会多嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亚当斯是你的朋友，也是我的朋友。可别忘了，那场让我们彼此结识的读书会就是他举办的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我怎么可能忘记？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当时可真是毫不留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说我的新书是“被流行文化牵着鼻子走的媚俗之作”，“唯一的用处就是成为富家太太和小姐们茶会上的谈资” 。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也说了作者的才华远不止于此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时的我从未想过，整个伦蒂尼姆最有眼光的评论家会是一位默默无闻的老师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能读懂你写下来的每一个句子，也能读懂你没有写出来的另外一百句——海蒂，这是你亲口说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我永远不会质疑我们之间的默契。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让我帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂，我们之间可以更坦诚......一如既往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁......我有没有告诉过你，很多年前，我曾有幸认识了一位并非萨科塔的拉特兰修士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也曾在伦蒂尼姆生活过，说不定与这所学校有些渊源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁女士，不好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，您有客人？这、这位是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位文学界的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉，有什么事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，外面......我以为您都听到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"远处传来了一些异响。\n伦蒂尼姆人对这样的声音并不敏感。\n一开始，人们很容易把这声音跟不小心引发的蒸汽锅炉爆炸，或者孩子们喜爱的机械羽兽划过半空的声响搞混。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但是随着房屋与地面的震动感越来越明显，所有人都被一种本能的恐慌包裹了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"仰赖诸王的庇佑，伦蒂尼姆从来没有遭遇过天灾，他们面临的无疑是另外的威胁——许多年长者反应过来，二十多年前的噩梦又回来了。\n战争的预兆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在人们沉默的间隙里，轰隆声更密集了起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是追捕几个犯人，为什么会闹出这么大的阵仗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我们总能明白所有人的想法的话，许多悲剧根本就不会发生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉，麻烦你去看一眼街道上的士兵还在不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。我很想劝你留下来，但我更加知道，就连炮火也阻止不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁，你也注意到了，今夜的伦蒂尼姆即将迎来又一次剧变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯塔福德公爵的军队正在对议会广场发起进攻。卡文迪许公爵的人也早就抵达了城墙外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十多年前的那场政变，它所带来的混乱，起码对于市民们来说只持续了很短的时间。而这次......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可能会演变成公爵们之间的战争，而发生地点，就在伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......先前取得了一些情报。它有机会拯救数万人的生命。我需要在明天天亮之前把这样东西送出城去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说，战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战火随时会蔓延到其他城市，所有维多利亚人都需要做好准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自陛下离去之后，维多利亚的和平已经持续了二十多年。许多人把这称作奇迹，而我早就不相信有什么奇迹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人会放弃利益，而如整个维多利亚那么大的利益......则会让有资格攫取它的人更加瞻前顾后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活在历史夹缝中的可怜人们，只好闭上眼睛，称呼它为，“和平”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......谁能想到，一场急病会促使斯塔福德公爵迈出这一步？谁又能预测其他公爵对此的反应？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有像你这样的人的付出的话，这场战争会在二十二年前就爆发，而不是拖到现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想安慰我吗，戈尔丁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在陈述一个事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂，你不用向我说明你此行的目的，更不用解释你们这么多年来的计划究竟是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只需要回答一个问题——和平还会再次到来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这始终是我们努力的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会守护自己的家园，这是维多利亚人世代信奉的真理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便会有无数人死在这条道路上，即便你们每一次以为自己即将到达道路的终点时，迎接你们的都是下一场注定发生的战争？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为战争终会结束。它会结束在我们或者我们的后继者的手上。等笼罩在维多利亚上空的烟尘散去，孩子们的笑脸上将再无阴霾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂，我愿意试着相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁，要是我还能回到伦蒂尼姆的话......等我们再次相聚，我会把所有的事情都说出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记住你的承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......活着回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
